^dServer

* Fixed ^8sv_serverTimeReset^9 0 breaking time wrap time reset

^dClient

* Increased scan ports tp display more LAN server list from ^84^9 to ^88^9
* Added ^8r_allowScreenSaver^9 cvar to allow DPMS while game is running

^dMod

^fGeneral

* Fixed hud_vX files were not listed properly when connection to pure server
* Decoupled ranks from skill rating. This restore rank progression to the existing XP
  system so that ranks reflect in-game progression again and are no longer dependent
  on stale empirical data
* Improved shuffle by SR algorithm with greedy SR draft that
  - Prioritizes balanced team player counts
  - Assigns the highest remaining rated player to the team with the lowest combined
    skill rating
  - Handles map bias to assign any remaining rated player to the side with the map
    disadvantage
* Changed rank accuracy-based awards by a sample-size-aware score
* Fixed SR data recorded without GUID by using connect-time guid for SR/XP db access
  to ensure valid user ID are stored into DB
* Fixed bot taking over player name and SR, resetting player SR
* Made SR map bias more dynamic
* Skipped SR updates when no players participated
* Fixed SR update leaks current match into prior map bias
* Reworked XP save functionality from the ground up
  - Removed ^8g_xpSaver^9 cvar and ^8g_xpSaverMaxAge^9 cvars
  - Removed broken ^8g_resetXPMapCount^9 and mapvote XP reset display
  - Scoped XP save to Objective and Mapvote via new ^8g_xpSave^9 cvar
  - Added configurable XP save reset policy for Objective/Mapvote with
    ^8g_xpSaveResetMode^9 and ^8g_xpSaveResetThreshold^9 cvars
  - Added maps-based, time-based and time decay XP save reset modes
  - Added Reset XP button on intermission screen
  - Added ^8reset_xpsave^9 server command
  - Allowed bots to use XP save.
* Fixed artillery shot counter decremented on dead bodies
* Fixed shot count when primed grenade is dropped on death
* Replaced tick-tock cadence with configurable reinforcement warning
* Renamed ^8cg_reinforceTickTock^9 cvar to ^8cg_reinforceWarningTime^9
* Fixed assist stats alignment in game stats
* Added missing kill assist field to Lua API

^fUI

* Added confirmation dialog on option homepath and main discord buttons
* Replaced ^8Color Gradient^9 style with ^8Reinforce Warning^9 option style from
  ^8reinforcement^9 component
* Added ^8Reinforce Warning^9 style to ^8roundtimer^9 component
* Decoupled ^8disconnect^9 component from ^8lagometer^9
* Added alternate warmup spawn timers with WARMUP text, so both fit nicely into
  component bound

^fAudio

* Added ^8cg_reinforceWarningAudio^9 cvar to toggle reinforcement warning sound
* Restricted reinforcement warning to active players

***
